## How we develop MOLONARI {#development}

Development happens on the `{{ branch }}` branch of every repository of the [Operating Space](https://molonari.io/operating-space/). This website follows that branch: its generated pages are rebuilt from it.

## Versions {#versions}

Each repository follows [SemVer](https://semver.org). The version is in the `[workspace]` table of its `pixi.toml`, and `pixi run bump-version` changes it everywhere it is mirrored. Current versions:

{% for r in repos if r.version %}- [{{ r.name }}]({{ r.url }}): {{ r.version }}
{% endfor %}
## Commits {#commits}

A commit subject starts with the project name and the new version, for example `{{ main.name }}-{{ main.version }} …`, and the same message is used in every repository the change touched. A release is tagged with `cgitsync tag`.

